#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"mpv is a free (as in freedom) media player for the command line. It supports "
"a wide variety of media file formats, audio and video codecs, and subtitle "
"types. mpv can leverage most hardware decoding APIs on all platforms."
msgstr "mpv 是一款自由（自由软件意义上的自由）的命令行媒体播放器。它支持多种媒体文件格式、音视频编解码器和字幕类型。mpv 可以在所有平台上利用大多数硬件解码 API。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/multimedia/_index.adoc:444
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Also targeted towards vidoephile, it has several high quality up-/"
"downscaling algorithms which can also be, like all settings, controlled via "
"profiles. Profiles can be selected via command-line switches or based on "
"conditions like the folder name."
msgstr "mpv 也面向影音发烧友，提供多种高质量的升频和降频算法。这些算法与所有设置一样，也可以通过配置文件控制。可以通过命令行开关选择配置文件，也可以根据文件夹名称等条件自动选择。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/multimedia/_index.adoc:446
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It also supports high quality HDR to SDR conversion with fine-grained "
"control, enabling everyone to enjoy HDR content on any display."
msgstr "它还支持高质量的 HDR 到 SDR 转换，并提供精细控制，让每个人都能在任何显示器上欣赏 HDR 内容。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/multimedia/_index.adoc:448
#, fuzzy
msgid "To install mpv, execute:"
msgstr "要安装 mpv，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/multimedia/_index.adoc:452
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install mpv\n"
msgstr "# pkg install mpv\n"

