#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/multimedia/_index.adoc:616
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Note here that if this is a plug-and-play USB webcam, changing the USB port "
"to which it is connected will change the output from `webcamd -l`, "
"specifically the device identifier, and the entry in rc.conf might need to "
"be updated. To avoid this issue either use the device name (`-N` option) and/"
