msgstr "请注意，此处的扫描仪是即插即用设备，更改其连接的 USB 端口会改变 `usbconfig list` 的输出。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/multimedia/_index.adoc:725
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "ugen3.2: <HP Deskjet 1050 J410 series> at usbus3, cfg=0 md=HOST spd=HIGH (480Mbps) pwr=ON (2mA)\n"
msgstr "ugen3.2: <HP Deskjet 1050 J410 series> at usbus3, cfg=0 md=HOST spd=HIGH (480Mbps) pwr=ON (2mA)\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
